31,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We have no deaths yet, but we must vote today. Does anyone have any leads?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I feel we are all such lovely people. It's hard to imagine a werewolf among us.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, your kindness is appreciated, but we must be vigilant.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I have some information. Shizue, I'm afraid you are the werewolf.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! Benjamin, are you sure? That's a huge claim!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, Benjamin. I assure you, I am just a humble old woman.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"If Benjamin is the Seer, the logic is simple. We execute Shizue.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I am indeed the Seer. My divination was clear.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,But Shizue is so nice! Maybe the Seer made a mistake?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minako,,"The Seer doesn't make mistakes in this game, Kenji.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a very sad misunderstanding, but I cannot force you to believe me.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,The evidence provided by the Seer is the most reliable tool we have.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I stand by my result. Shizue is the werewolf.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I guess I have to trust the Seer, even if it feels wrong.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minako,,I'm convinced. Let's vote for Shizue.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I hope you all find peace.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Shizue it is.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let us proceed with the execution.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Okay, I'll vote with everyone else.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
